# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/build/
**/coverage/
target/

# Lockfiles and pnpm-managed config. pnpm and Dependabot rewrite these in their
# own style, which would fight format:check.
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml

# Generated code — regenerated by `pnpm generate`, must match the generator's output
packages/sdk/src/schema.ts
packages/api-contracts/openapi.json
openapitools.json

# Shared policy data for the Go decision engine — regenerated by
# `pnpm generate:worker-policy-data` and byte-compared in CI, so Prettier must
# not reformat it out from under the generator.
apps/worker/internal/worker/semantic_topics.json
packages/policy-schema/native/src/generated/
conformance/

# MDX is excluded deliberately. Prettier collapses a multi-line component
# (`<Step>\ntext\n</Step>`) onto one line, which flips the inner content from
# block Markdown to inline and can change what the docs site renders. Unlike
# code, there is no test or typecheck that would catch such a change.
**/*.mdx
